Proposed findings (13-16):
1. **Critical**: CIMD on Workers needs a DNS-pinned transport; plan says only size/time caps. Evidence PLAN.md:70-78, 320; Better Auth CIMD docs. Fix: implement/port a Workers transport that resolves once, rejects RFC 6890, pins address, refuses redirects; spike 0a must test it.
2. **Critical**: `confirm: true` is not a human confirmation; a prompt-injected agent can call destructive tools. `update_cv_content`/`edit_document_text` let the agent write arbitrary prose, bypassing anti-hallucination. Evidence PLAN.md:118-122, 168-188; `cover-letter-prompt.ts:121-141`. Fix: out-of-band confirmation (web approval / short-lived token), restrict free-text edits to mechanical fields, route prose through the verified writer.
3. **Critical**: Two-column reading order fix uses CSS `order`, which changes paint/content-stream order; `modern-professional` has the same sidebar-first DOM and is missed. Evidence PLAN.md:214; `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:231/368`, `USModernATSTemplate.tsx:183/320`. Fix: grid placement/absolute positioning with main first in DOM; fix both templates; add a text-order assertion per template.
4. **Critical**: Paper override on fixed-width templates; `@page` margins + template padding; DACH margins not applied. Evidence PLAN.md:184, 204-205, 264; `USPremiumATSTemplate.tsx:55-64`, `GermanClassicTemplate.tsx:63-66`, `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:48-51`. Fix: make template width/paper a prop, set `@page margin: 0` with template padding or move all margins to `@page`, and test A4/Letter.
5. **High**: Idempotency still depends on the client reusing the key; a retry with a fresh UUID double-charges. Evidence PLAN.md:98-100; section 2 says clients retry with fresh ids. Fix: server-side input fingerprint dedupe within a window, plus optional client key.
6. **High**: Success path is not atomic; cancel/lease races and partial kit refunds. Evidence PLAN.md:110-112, 174; `credit-costs.ts:23-28`; `credits.ts:1420/1472`. Fix: one batch for persist+capture+status; conditional cancel; lease heartbeat > max generation; per-document refunds.
7. **High**: Free LLM/Browser Run operations (`save_cv`, `draft_screening_answers`, `export_documents`) have no credit/rate cap; looping agent can burn model and Browser Run cost. Evidence PLAN.md:114-115, 175, 184; `parse-cv/route.ts:34-35`; `files/upload/route.ts` limits. Fix: per-user rate limits + daily export/save quotas, size caps.
8. **High**: Server renderer imports `'use client'` templates and needs the app's CSS; `renderToStaticMarkup` may see client references. Evidence `USPremiumATSTemplate.tsx:1`, `cv-templates/index.tsx`; PLAN.md:197-198. Fix: server-safe presentational components + a dedicated print CSS; spike 0b must render one template end-to-end.
9. **High**: DIN description omits the 5-line Zusatz-/Vermerkzone and 27.3mm Anschriftzone; recipient address starts ~62.7mm, not 45/50mm; no Informationsblock/fold marks. Evidence PLAN.md:256-261; din-formate.info. Fix: encode the zones and add a position assertion for the recipient, date, info block, fold marks.
10. **High**: Cover letter layout has no locale input; `cover_letter_language` is written nowhere; language is detected into `requirements.detectedLanguage`. Evidence PLAN.md:171, 184, 223-225; `schema.ts:370`; `regenerate/route.ts:214-225`; `useSupabaseSync.ts:53`. Fix: expose/detect locale, choose DIN vs US from it, add `locale` to export tool and hash.
11. **High**: Structured letter contract conflicts with the prompt's explicit ban on company address lines. Evidence `cover-letter-prompt.ts:217`; PLAN.md:223. Fix: update the prompt and source verified recipient details from `company_address`/`company_contact_person`; add a test.
12. **Medium**: 9.5pt floor vs 12px (9pt) body; changing it repaginates. Evidence PLAN.md:219; `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:55`. Fix: set 10pt or re-layout and re-baseline.
13. **Medium**: Tool annotations are conditional ("yes when regenerate", "when replacing"), but `destructiveHint` is static. Evidence PLAN.md:160, 175. Fix: true for any tool that can destroy; set `idempotentHint` too.
14. **Medium**: Loopback redirect exact-match allowlist will break Claude Code/Cursor random ports; Better Auth's DCR `infer` handles it. Evidence PLAN.md:78; Better Auth MCP docs. Fix: use Better Auth's native redirect validation with `infer`, allow loopback any port.
15. **Medium**: Reviewer account seeding misses email verification, credits, CV, feed consent. Evidence PLAN.md:52, 326; `auth/server.ts:88`. Fix: seed verified account with CV/credits/sample kit.
16. **Low**: Tool count is 39, not 40 (13+6+20). Evidence PLAN.md:190 tables. Fix: correct the count or add the missing tool.
17. **Low**: Greenhouse caps uploads at 100 MB, not 2.5 MB; the 2MB target is a parse target. Evidence PLAN.md:244; Greenhouse support. Fix: cite the parse cap.
18. **Low**: `createMcpHandler` comes from `@modelcontextprotocol/server` v2, not Cloudflare; `McpAgent` isn't "deprecated". Evidence PLAN.md:21; Better Auth docs. Fix: name the SDK.
19. **Low**: DACH margin change is in section 6 but not in section 5's template work; date separators are in all 6 templates and not in the work list. Evidence PLAN.md:212-220, 242; `GermanClassicTemplate.tsx:66`, all templates line 395/432. Fix: add margin/date work to PR 3.

