For the `confirm` finding: evidence `PLAN.md:118-122`, `PLAN.md:168-188`; `cover-letter-prompt.ts:121-141` (anti-hallucination). Fix: out-of-band approval (web app consent or short-lived server-issued confirmation token bound to the user and tool), and restrict `update_cv_content`/`edit_document_text` to mechanical fields or route prose through the verified writer. Good.

For the two-column: evidence `PLAN.md:214`; `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:231`/`:368`; `USModernATSTemplate.tsx:183`/`:320`. Fix: grid-column placement or absolute sidebar with main first in DOM; fix both; assert text order with pdftotext/pdf.js per template; don't rely on `order`.

For paper: evidence `PLAN.md:184`, `:204-205`, `:250`, `:264`; `USPremiumATSTemplate.tsx:55-64`; `GermanClassicTemplate.tsx:63-66`; `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:48-51`. Fix: make paper/width a renderer input, not a page-level override; move margins to one owner (`@page { margin: 0 }` + template padding or the reverse); test A4/Letter; apply the 25mm/20mm DACH margins.

For idempotency: evidence `PLAN.md:98-100`; `PLAN.md:45` says clients retry with fresh ids; `schema.ts:1006` global unique. Fix: dedupe on `(user, tool, input_hash)` for a TTL window, not only on the client key; keep the key for explicit retries.

For atomicity: evidence `PLAN.md:102-112`, `:174`; `credit-costs.ts:23-28`; `credits.ts:1420`/`:1472`. Fix: one D1 batch for persist + capture + status; conditional cancel; lease heartbeat/expiry > max model time; per-document refunds.

For single writer: evidence `PLAN.md:92`; `agent-v2/route.ts:252` writes `generated_artifacts`; `regenerate/route.ts:315`; `tracker/follow-up/route.ts:239`; `useSupabaseSync.ts:648-679`. Fix: route all through `persistKit`, bump revision in one place; define `generated_artifacts` vs canonical precedence.

For free abuse: evidence `PLAN.md:114-115`, `:175`, `:184`; `parse-cv/route.ts:34-35`; `files/upload/route.ts`; `credits.ts` only charges credits. Fix: per-user rate limits and daily quotas for `save_cv`, `draft_screening_answers`, `export_documents`; cap base64 input at 4.5/10MB; add `RATE_LIMIT_MCP`.

For server render: evidence `USPremiumATSTemplate.tsx:1` `'use client'`; `PLAN.md:197-198`; `cv-templates/index.tsx`. Fix: extract server-safe presentational components; add a print CSS; spike 0b must render one template with fonts/photo/tagging through the actual route.

For DIN: evidence `PLAN.md:256-261`; din-formate.info. Fix: encode the 5-line Zusatz-/Vermerkzone (17.7mm) and 6-line Anschriftzone (27.3mm); recipient at ~62.7mm; add Informationsblock (125mm left, 75mm wide) and fold marks (105/210mm); assert positions in the eval.

For letter locale: evidence `PLAN.md:171`, `:184`, `:223-225`; `schema.ts:370`; `regenerate/route.ts:214-225`; `useSupabaseSync.ts:53`. Fix: use `requirements.detectedLanguage` or a persisted `letter_locale`, expose it in `get_application`, add `locale` to `export_documents` and the cache key; choose DIN vs US from it.

For prompt conflict: evidence `cover-letter-prompt.ts:217`; `PLAN.md:223`. Fix: update the prompt to allow a recipient block only from verified `company_address`/`company_contact_person`; add a test that a missing recipient stays blank, not invented.

For 9.5pt: evidence `PLAN.md:219`; `GermanATSTemplate.tsx:55`. Fix: 13.33px (10pt) or 12.67px (9.5pt) and re-baseline page counts/visual judge.

For annotations: evidence `PLAN.md:160`, `:175`; MCP annotations are static booleans. Fix: `destructiveHint: true` for any tool that can overwrite/delete; add `idempotentHint` for spend tools.

For loopback: evidence `PLAN.md:78`; Better Auth MCP docs. Fix: use native client validation with `clientRegistrationDefaultApplicationType: "infer"`; allow loopback any port; keep exact match for web clients.

For reviewer seed: evidence `PLAN.md:52`, `:326`; `auth/server.ts:88`. Fix: seed `emailVerified`, credits, a primary CV, and a sample application; document no MFA.

For PR ordering: evidence `PLAN.md:318-326`; `cv-tools.ts:86`; `PLAN.md:148`. Fix: PR 3 must update `cv-tools.ts` or keep a shim; add PR 3 to PR 5's dependencies for measured ATS levels; assign the chat-tool rewrite to one PR.

